    <value>Do not close purchase orders before all goods are received</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>سفارش‌های خرید پیش از دریافت همه کالاها بسته نشوند</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Non chiudere gli ordini ai fornitori senza ricevimento completo</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Nie zamykaj zamówień do dostawców bez pełnego wpływu</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Не закрывать заказы поставщикам без полного поступления</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Tam giriş olmadan satın alma siparişlerini kapatma</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Không đóng đơn hàng đặt nhà cung cấp mà chưa tiếp nhận toàn bộ</value>
